{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c47faae02810424b9c31ad3bd8245ef5f75355b599d3d8eca3312e130435c3ae", "ja": "（取引先から美容ドリンクをもらった。\nこういうのは、みんな喜ぶよな）", "zh": "（合作方送了我美容饮品。这种东西，大家应该都会喜欢吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1001_p", "source_sha256": "01e2db2c6a703018f00bafc3f2200f2b8e21109a7c347bf3bda2a930f796a0c4", "ja": "（今は、百合子が自主レッスンをしてるはずだ。\n差し入れに持っていこう）", "zh": "（现在百合子应该正在自主训练。拿去给她当慰问品吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f7c95d3974bdff198db73d06e92d8d90542dfbdbeb425e49467e1bc8771047ae", "ja": "お疲れさま……。", "zh": "辛苦了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "194a162aeec935078757db236d3ba5d3c456f700c66ea91f37c82276a3dade4d", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん……。\nお、お疲れ様です～……、はぅぅ……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……\n您、您辛苦了～……哈呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7a243035cf851c23bde376b70947ebf9aa0b07dced3a5945a12ce68e2ee82632", "ja": "百合子！？\nどうしたんだ、へとへとじゃないか……。", "zh": "百合子！？\n怎么了，累得筋疲力尽的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ae0ba6ef68fd49411f14ad634e28f92b1215b42d1a737398e2e02066ce5fcabf", "ja": "そんなにレッスン頑張ったのか？　ちょうど\nここに冷えたドリンクがあるから、飲んで。", "zh": "练习得这么拼命吗？正好这里有冰镇饮料，喝点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "1bbf6663240e9bae65e628ff0c7308077270a54ed000a9a86c6df59ae0b0a87c", "ja": "うう、ありがとうございます～……。", "zh": "呜呜，谢谢您～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "579971e8c1a11b38918d20931ef46a30fbfc37e6e80f6cd9a08dc0487f154440", "ja": "ハッ！？　これ、美容ドリンクですか？\nダメダメ！　これはダメです！", "zh": "哈！？这是美容饮料吗？\n不行不行！这个不可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4fbbffc1d1e4ce6b2e897443f71a009ee635d6c0ca79bc9ac8f36cd20480537c", "ja": "えっ。ど、どうして？", "zh": "诶。为、为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "4566b2b4e1d544b1dfc1aff37769404ddf38d8bd0d2425964af176a0e4c600e4", "ja": "どうしてって……私が、今度のステージで演じる\n一宮織姫は、重い病気なんですよ？", "zh": "你问为什么……因为我将在下次舞台上饰演的一宫织姬，可是身患重病啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "1d39ea25f4be5de019701fcfde5215799898516cc5e8b8fb23b4a0723d1e70a5", "ja": "肌がツヤツヤで健康的なんて、説得力がありません！\n儚くて、透明で、今にも消えてしまいそうでないと……", "zh": "皮肤光滑红润、看起来很健康的话，根本没有说服力！\n必须要给人一种虚幻、透明，仿佛随时都会消失的感觉才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "96191a08e05b8ad2cce99142ecacb7ccb9915e905951ebe9e1fa038c9ba4aa14", "ja": "ただでさえ、演じるのが私なんです！\nそんな雰囲気を出すのが難しいんですから！", "zh": "更何况，出演的人是我啊！要表现出那种氛围，本来就很难嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c9b903fe4471b95f7a01b2df44d4b6da375a288465fe118cd375f7d5d9e98455", "ja": "自分で言うんだな……。でも病室だけじゃなくて、\n最後には華々しいステージもあるじゃないか。", "zh": "你还真会自己说啊……不过，不只是病房，最后还有一场华丽的舞台嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "ed6078aac4b84fad6275825ca35c8c75ac16afae131026822567dc32d79fecea", "ja": "だからですよ！　すこしやつれているほうが、\n織姫の想いの強さを表現できると思いませんか？", "zh": "正因为这样啊！你不觉得，稍微憔悴一点，更能表现出织姬的情感有多强烈吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6d570b426fba4cc4448f827d1c2f3e70bc76eea87105d31460a42ffd6fdfad7e", "ja": "百合子の年齢で、過度な減量は禁物だ。今回は\n映像じゃなくて舞台だし、雰囲気ならメイクで補える。", "zh": "以百合子这个年纪，不能过度减重。这次不是拍影像，而是舞台剧，想要的氛围可以用化妆来弥补。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5644ef4c64615c1dbff2e16084bca67fbf997c7bcd281ff87abc29a8b63293bd", "ja": "それに、プロモーションもあるし。やっぱり、\nいつもの元気で可愛い百合子のほうがいいと思う！", "zh": "而且还要做宣传。果然，我还是觉得平时那个活泼可爱的百合子更好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "28bb4c248fdfc996913046982d62e0848cebb7af17e6360153dfa70f760a918d", "ja": "えっ！？　か、可愛いとか……{$P$}\nさん、いつもそんなことを考えてるんですか！？", "zh": "诶！？可、可爱什么的……{$P$}\n先生，您平时一直都在想这种事吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5de982dd8b7af2ae8f57a6ae745810e211a69b6fd6e294861871812d2bbc2a28", "ja": "え？　そりゃ、プロデューサーだし。\n百合子はアイドルだし……。", "zh": "诶？那当然了，因为我是制作人嘛。\n百合子可是偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "1bf0bc47fd19f36ebdd144db35f844ae084b7e6e96db0513f1a402191ae3e08f", "ja": "軽率すぎます！　そういうの、本当に絶対\nダメなんですからね！　仕事中だけにしてください！", "zh": "太轻率了！这种事真的绝对不行！只能在工作的时候这样，知道了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1020_p", "source_sha256": "bd37bcaec42df1c916ab4ea8589a99ad9504f8146efdb227e8fd394260734d81", "ja": "いや、今仕事中……。", "zh": "不，现在就是工作时间……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "59d0bec9485656da28043888016c5bbda140a03efba79217e6419832901df9e7", "ja": "わかりました、減量はほどほどにします……。\nドリンク、頂きますね。……あ、パッケージ可愛い♪", "zh": "我知道了，减重我会适可而止的……\n饮料我就收下啦。……啊，包装好可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0563_1022_p", "source_sha256": "df637dec96e516fe5da4274f64487118d62a0a3779f906cfdb793ba80516266c", "ja": "（……とにかく、相当気合いが入っている証拠だな。\n最終幕のプレッシャーもあるだろうけど、頑張れ！）", "zh": "（……总之，这就是她干劲十足的证据吧。虽然最终幕的压力应该也不小，但加油！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
